  "releaseNotes": "v5.0.1 - Fixed: the package no longer passes Microsoft.Extensions.Telemetry.Abstractions build assets and its source generators to consumers, so a consumer's [LoggerMessage] methods use the standard logging generator again. Every Telemetry.Abstractions analyzer is removed, Microsoft.Gen.Logging and Microsoft.Gen.Metrics included; a consumer that uses those generators should reference Microsoft.Extensions.Telemetry.Abstractions directly to keep them (#62). See CHANGELOG.md.",
